WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.779
Step 1. In the facility sidebar, under Services, select Referrals.

1.2
00:00:04.779 --> 00:00:07.318
If your role is only in a department,

1.3
00:00:07.318 --> 00:00:12.142
the page first shows You do not have access to these referrals.

2.1
00:00:12.142 --> 00:00:16.751
Step 2. Select Filter, then Department, and choose the department.

2.2
00:00:16.751 --> 00:00:21.309
A department's list shows only the referrals sent to that department,

2.3
00:00:21.309 --> 00:00:24.517
not to the departments or teams under it.

3.1
00:00:24.517 --> 00:00:26.412
Step 3. Read the list.

3.2
00:00:26.412 --> 00:00:31.797
It shows the newest referrals first, with the Referral, Patient, Status,

3.3
00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:35.138
Assigned to, and Created Date columns.

4.1
00:00:35.138 --> 00:00:41.371
Step 4. Select the title of the referral. Care opens the referral on its own page.

4.2
00:00:41.371 --> 00:00:44.790
To go back, select Back at the top left.
